# Built JS/CSS bundles — produced by `npm run build:all`.
# Framework bundles live in Alis.Reactive.Assets/dist/ and are served to
# the sandbox via a CompositeFileProvider in SandboxApp/Program.cs and
# packed into the NuGet by Alis.Reactive.csproj — never copied into
# sandbox wwwroot. Sandbox-only bundles live in SandboxApp/wwwroot/.
Alis.Reactive.Assets/dist/
Alis.Reactive.SandboxApp/wwwroot/js/sandbox-plugins.js
Alis.Reactive.SandboxApp/wwwroot/css/sandbox.css

# The downloadable example zip is regenerated fresh on every docs deploy
# (see .github/workflows/deploy-docs.yml — runs rebuild-example-app.sh
# before `npm run build`). Tracking the zip would only serve a stale copy
# until someone manually rebuilds and commits; CI is the source of truth.
# Local dev regenerates on demand by running scripts/rebuild-example-app.sh.
docs-site/public/downloads/resident-intake.zip
